    "id": "pose_52_sitting_ladylike_hands_on_thighs",
    "name": "Ladylike floor sitting, hands on the thighs",
    "description": "Sitting on the floor between the heels with the knees forward together and the shins folded out to the sides, the torso upright and both hands resting on the thighs with the fingers draping forward. The head stays level. Left/right are the character's own.",
    "targetModels": [
      "female",
      "male"
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      "Single front-view line drawing used as reference; the buttocks hover in side view and the knees sit less forward than the drawing because the rig calf limit (140 deg) cannot make the true wariza fold (~160 deg).",
      "Knees share floor contact with toes grazing; both palms rest on the thighs; root height is the female/male mean within the 10 mm floor tolerance.",
      "Authored on rig/female.glb; the male reuses the same rotations with the hips-height-relative root offset."
    ],
    "generator": "scripts/pose_author/lib.py + /tmp/author_floor.py (poses-only scope; authoring script not committed)"
  },
